hangEachSideMm":176.740533806749,"twoPiece":false,"brackets":2,"fit":"ideal","overallWithFinialsMm":1140,"note":"cut 12 cm off each end"}],"timingsMs":{"uploadMs":8433,"handsTimedOut":1,"measureMs":36689,"windowOutline":0,"framesWithHandsSetAside":1,"spanMs":32633,"handsMs":72474,"draftMs":47876,"totalMs":119463},"models":["sam-3.1","sam-3.1 (video tracking: hands)","muse-voice-transcribe-1.0","muse-spark-1.3 (which edges)","muse-spark-1.3"],"widthMm":606.518932386502,"heightMm":null,"spreadMm":5.021715076441183,"framesUsed":6,"heroFrame":71,"span":{"adopted":false,"widthMm":606.518932386502,"frameWidthMm":606.518932386502,"why":"outer trim edges match 63cm A4 scale","left":"A","right":"B","edges":[{"xMm":-290.4416746833817,"strength":0,"label":"A","measured":true},{"xMm":316.07725770312027,"strength":0,"label":"B","measured":true}],"votes":"3 of 3 agreed with the outline"},"draft":{"curtainType":"unknown","chosenStockCm":120,"diameterMm":35,"reply":"Thanks for the video and for explaining about the paper below the window. Your estimate of 63 cm is very close to my measure of 60.7 cm for the outside of the window frame.\n\nI would suggest the 120 cm pole cut down to 96 cm, taking 12 cm off each end with a fine-tooth saw. That gives 17.7 cm past the frame on each side for the curtains to stack. Please allow 9 cm at each end for the finials beyond the 96 cm, and remember I cannot accept returns on cut poles.\n\nInstructions are included and eyelet curtains fit straight on the pole. Best wishes, Rob","questions":[],"ranOn":"muse-spark-1.3"},"fps":3,"blinds":{"options":[{"fit":"outside, standard","widthMm":705,"dropMm":null,"overlapEachSideMm":50,"note":"covers the opening with a little to spare each side"},{"fit":"outside, blackout","widthMm":765,"dropMm":null,"overlapEachSideMm":80,"note":"wider overlap so less light gets round the sides"}],"draft":{"reply":"Hello there, thanks for the clip. I know the paper had to go underneath, but I could still work from it.\n\nI measured the outside of the window frame or its surround at 60.7 cm.\n\nFor an outside standard fit, please order 70.5 cm wide, which gives 5 cm overlap each side to cover the opening with a little to spare each side.\n\nFor an outside blackout fit, please order 76.5 cm wide, which gives 8 cm overlap each side for wider overlap so less light gets round the sides.\n\nI could not get the drop from the clip, so could you measure the height for me and tell me which edges you measured between?\n\nBest wishes","questions":["Could you please measure the height and let me know which edges you measured between?"]},"model":"muse-spark-1.3"}}